ts at WI-144 with the reconcile recorded. I stopped at this boundary deliberately: WI-144 is a large campaign-closing BUILD slice (a UI-quality pass across the SVG emitters) whose acceptance, per SR-047/SR-052-054, *must* come from a **fresh, provider-heterogeneous CRITIQUE session** — never the authoring session — so it can't be self-adjudicated here and belongs to its own focused BUILD session, matching the loop's reconcile-then-BUILD rhythm.\n\nTwo notes for the next session:\n- One informational `WARN` (WI-143, now done, still named in `status.md`) is expected this session since the reconcile is *about* WI-143's review; it should clear at the WI-144 gate-bar close.\n- Nothing was pushed (`push-policy: human`). OI-3 (push), OI-4 (LICENSE), OI-7 (review cadence), and now OI-11 remain open but block nothing under `single-ratify`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":84173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b65bea5-14c0-4874-b25c-d76620914fac","uuid":"1de421ff-12a9-4348-895d-49c3cc13c535","request_id":"req_011Cd2cBkXvMyJA1pCeeu8dk"}
